ry much the hope that as he  repairs his relationship with harry and  with megan he's going to get more time  with his grandchildren which he's very  much hoping for now it seems all these  reunions are a positive step in mending  the relationship between the family and  moving forward is what prince charles  wants to do i do know that charles  absolutely wants to start healing that  fractured relationship with harry i was  told by a source very close to him that  he loves his son that he will forgive  his son for everything and that he wants  to repair that relationship and move on  and i think a big part of that is also  wanting to get to be a grandfather and  see those grandchildren it may mean a  few more transatlantic trips but he  wants to enjoy those experiences  [Music]  you
 

